{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4aad2b26-7a4e-8bbd-a34f-16b91e2d50ae",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T16:02:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Andres Mejia",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T15:59:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T15:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Tony. Andres Mejia. I'm calling about my water and sewer bill. A payment I made came back from my bank, bounced, and I want to know where that stands."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T15:59:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T15:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "240 Kingston Avenue. Up on the Hill, the house past where the old gas station used to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T15:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 240 Kingston. Give me a second to pull that up. [pause] Okay, I see the account. And you said the payment was returned?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T15:59:57-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. My bank sent me a notice saying it was returned. But it was my bank's mix-up, there was money in there. I got the paper bill right here in my hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:00:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's the date on the bill?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Says December ninth. Statement date December ninth. And there's a line on here, a returned payment charge on top of the water. That's not right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I see it. So what happened is the payment posted, then it got reversed when the bank sent it back. So the original balance is open again, and the returned payment fee got added on top of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:00:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'm getting charged for the bank's mistake. Great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:00:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Right now the account shows the balance due, plus that fee. Nothing's been paid against it since the reversal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:00:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on one second, I'm in the grocery store. [pause] I'm looking for the, what's the brand, Bob's Red Mill oats, the old fashioned. They moved everything around since the last time. Sorry, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, take your time. I'll just say, I can't remove that fee from here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then I want a supervisor to look at the charge. I didn't do anything wrong. Can you put me through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can ask. Let me see if my supervisor's free this late in the day. [pause] It's almost four on a Monday, so she may be tied up. Can I put you on hold a minute?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, go ahead. I'm not going anywhere. [crosstalk] Oh, found the oats, finally. Bottom shelf, behind the flour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:34-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good deal. Okay, I'm back. She's on another call. I can send her a note with your account and what you told me, and she can call you back. Is the number on the account the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, use this cell. 401-555-0168."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:01:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0168, got it. I'll note that you're disputing the returned payment fee because the bank made the error, and that you want it reviewed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:02:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And I want it to say that I'm asking about the status of the original payment too. Is it going to count as late?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:02:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put that in the note. The late question is something the supervisor can answer better than me, so she'll cover it when she calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:02:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. When do you figure she'll call?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Likely tomorrow, maybe the day after with the holiday week. I'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:02:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thanks, Tony."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T16:02:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Mejia. Enjoy the oats."
    }
  ],
